 Log←{
     ⍝ ⍵ ←→ Response
     s←⍵.Message.Connection.Server
     t←s.LogFileTie
     l←s.LogHTTP
     ∨/0=t,l:0
     ~l∊1 2:0
     e←l{⍺=1:CreateLogEntry ⍵ ⋄ CreateFullLogEntry ⍵}⍵
     ~t∊⎕NNUMS:0                    ⍝ Must stay right before ⎕NAPPEND: see `LogRumba`
     _←e ⎕NAPPEND t
     0
 }
